1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,583
Valence bond theory gives shapes, but not colours or magnetism.

2
00:00:04,583 --> 00:00:07,018
Crystal field theory does both.

3
00:00:07,018 --> 00:00:10,429
It treats the ligands as point negative charges.

4
00:00:10,429 --> 00:00:14,830
In a free ion all five d orbitals have the same energy.

5
00:00:14,830 --> 00:00:22,330
When ligands approach, they repel the d electrons, and orbitals that point straight at the ligands are pushed up the most.

